- /exam-creator wizard: upload -> AI splits into units -> pick units -> counts/types/request -> review -> PDF + online link
- analyze-file-units + rewritten generate-exam-from-file (units scope, tables copied cell-by-cell, figures cropped from source, verification pass)
- online-exam public function: answers never sent to client, server-side grading
- migration: online_exams, online_exam_submissions (RLS), exam-figures bucket
- home page showcase + navbar; old /exam-generator redirected (legacy kept at /exam-generator-legacy)
